  ('fp-g00552', 'forest-production', 'forest-management', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'Which Philippine law primarily governs the participation of local communities in forest resource management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"RA 8371 - Indigenous Peoples'' Rights Act"},{"id":"b","text":"RA 7586 - National Integrated Protected Areas System Act"},{"id":"c","text":"PD 705 - Revised Forestry Code of the Philippines"},{"id":"d","text":"RA 11038 - Expanded NIPAS Act"}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fp-g00553', 'forest-production', 'forest-management', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In forest management, what is a common purpose of implementing a ''clearcutting'' system?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"To completely remove invasive species"},{"id":"b","text":"To regenerate even-aged stands of particular species"},{"id":"c","text":"To enhance biodiversity by selective cutting"},{"id":"d","text":"To allow for the natural spread of seeds from remaining trees"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fp-g00554', 'forest-production', 'forest-management', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the primary function of forest management plans in sustainable forest management?',
